{"id": "EUVD-2026-87944", "enisaUuid": "bc77f316-cd3d-37ff-8a54-45b9ed7ccbed", "description": "Sylius versions before 2.1.16 and 2.2.9 fail to validate payment amounts during cart recalculation, allowing unauthenticated attackers to modify order totals after gateway transaction initiation. Attackers can pay a small amount, enlarge the order after gateway capture, and have the system mark the inflated order as fully paid while the gateway captured only the original amount.", "datePublished": "2026-09-27T13:09:56", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-06T13:36:51", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/Sylius/Sylius/security/advisories/GHSA-vv4h-q2x8-74g4", "https://github.com/Sylius/Sylius/pull/19216", "https://github.com/Sylius/Sylius/commit/9e9aeaacbc97b1fc01d573e44d6679194527905d", "https://github.com/Sylius/Sylius/releases/tag/v2.2.9", "https://github.com/Sylius/Sylius", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/sylius-2-x-before-2.1.16-and-2.2.9-payment-amount-overwrite"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-100872", "GHSA-2hp7-mfr2-4fg8"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "61dbcf50-4d13-3b93-9d64-f88b2420fbba", "product": {"name": "Sylius", "vendor": {"name": "Sylius"}}, "product_version": "2.2.0 <2.2.9"}, {"id": "81f0d59c-b777-3f44-b081-5a256ee47682", "product": {"name": "Sylius", "vendor": {"name": "Sylius"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0 <2.1.16"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "85b24442-0683-36f3-a4ed-9111f1cae447", "vendor": {"name": "Sylius"}}], "isExploited": false}